//
// Returns delivery attempt records from a store that keeps the most recent 10,000; older ones are discarded. Three modes, chosen by the parameters: without start the connection stays open and streams each new record as it happens until the client disconnects; with start alone the stored records from that time are sent first and the stream then stays live; with start plus end or count the call returns the matching stored records and ends. start=0 begins at the oldest record held. subscription and target filter every mode. A record is kept for every failed attempt, and for every attempt of a subscription with debug set. Requires a platform admin, a project admin (project subscriptions in the artifact, artifact_property, docker and build domains only), the Manage Webhooks role, or a token scoped system:webhooks@<project>/<url> with r.
